  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (7)': Hidden Base, Rendezvous Point, 'Marker', Heading For The Medical Frigate, Do, Or Do Not & Wise Advice, Squadron Assignments and 'Ultimatium OR Ounee Ta'; these count toward the 60 (total 60 as published). Several Effects start, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "'Marker' is the hidden-base system marker; the strategy says 'Any system (except Courscant) can be your HB. I really dont care which one, I choose randomly before each tornament', so no card is named: kept as posted (UNKNOWN).",
  "'Ultimatium OR Ounee Ta' (Starting) and 'Ounee Ta OR Ultimatium' (Effects) are either-or lines, kept as posted (UNKNOWN); per the strategy Ounee Ta starts against MKOS, Court and RalOps and Ultimatum otherwise, so the deck holds one of each.",
  "Posted 'EPP Luke' dested Luke With Lightsaber; 'LS,RS' Luke Skywalker, Rebel Scout; 'Lando Calrissian (CC)' the Light Cloud City Lando Calrissian; 'Tycho' Tycho Celchu; 'JAP Grimtassh' Grimtaash; 'Courscant' Coruscant.",
